running (booted)

$ virsh domstate linuc --reason
running (booted)

$ virsh destroy linuc
Domain 'linuc' destroyed

$ virsh domstate linuc --reason
shut off (destroyed)

$ virsh start linuc
Domain 'linuc' started

$

